// float4-group stride T is a multiple of D2/gcd(4, D2), which keeps
// (head + 4*g) mod D2 invariant, so every thread owns a fixed set of 4
// output columns. Partial maxima are merged with a single round of
// order-preserving unsigned atomicMax per thread, bracketed by tiny
// init/unmap passes over the (B, D2) output.
